Positivus Landing Page Design
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

Portions of the visual design used in the RealChain frontend
(color palette, typography choices, card and section composition,
button shapes, and section layouts) are adapted from:

    Positivus Landing Page Design
    by Olga (@olgaaverchenko)
    https://www.figma.com/community/file/1230604708032389430/positivus-landing-page-design

A coded reference implementation by zakariamouhid was also consulted:

    https://github.com/zakariamouhid/positivus-from-figma

The original work is licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution
4.0 International License (CC BY 4.0):

    https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

Changes made by RealChain
-------------------------
- Reimplemented from scratch in React + Vite + plain JavaScript
  (the original is Next.js + TypeScript + Tailwind CSS).
- Adapted the marketing-agency content surface to a tokenized real
  estate dApp (services, CTA, "how it works", footer all rewritten).
- Replaced the original raster illustrations with hand-built inline
  SVGs that match RealChain's domain.
- Combined the design with RealChain's existing Web3/UGF wiring,
  routing, and dApp pages.

This NOTICE file satisfies the attribution requirement of CC BY 4.0
for the Positivus design.


